    "text": "By LODGING Staff ,\n1 days ago New Hyatt data showed that loyalty programs continue to be a more important part of how travelers plan and pay for vacations: more than half of survey respondents said they’ve taken a trip that wouldn’t have been possible without travel rewards. That shift is reshaping how brands think about loyalty. Read full article",
